    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wendo pa Nyamicala ma Seba",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.12.42"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 12:42",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.11.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 11:31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyamicala ma Seba owinjo kwoŋ ŋeyirok pa Solomon aka okidho i Yerusalem temo go gi penji matek.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go obino gi kitipa madwoŋ ma jotic pere, gi ŋamin ma jotiŋo gigipiny maŋwe kur, thiwino, kodi zahabu madit. Munyo go gi Solomon joromo, openjo Solomon penji je m'oparo kwoŋe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomon odwoko penji je, aka ongoye gim'otek rigo tito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyamicala ma Seba owinjo rieko pa Solomon aka oneno peco pere m'ogeto, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "cemo m'itoko i meza pere, pecin pa jodhum pere, kitipin pa jotic kodi ŋecin pere kodi nangin pajo ma cale ma joruko, jotic pere, kodi cowirok ma Solomon miyo i Ot pa Were aka cunye okwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyamicala ma Seba owaco ri Solomon ni, “Gim'awinjo i piny paran ma mako kwoŋ tim perin kodi rieko perin obedo adieri! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To akinyalo yeyo cuka an won abino t'aneno. Aka neni adec mere oyido k'owaci ran. Iriek kalo kama ji jowaco. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Josilwany a ji perin! Josilwany a ŋecin perin me, ma noknok jonitie ruwaŋin aka jonitie gi silwany ma winjo rieko perin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth Were perin wopak m'onyutho nger m'osangal'iye kodin to kethin kere, dhumo i nyinge. Kwoŋbedo mar pere ri Isiraili kiwire, okethin bedo kere pajo ŋey inyal kuro cik kodi tiro.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyamicala omiyo Solomon mic m'okelo; zahabu ma kalo kilo 4,000 kodi gigipiny maŋwe kur kodi thiwino madit. Ongoye kendo dito ma gigipiny maŋwe kur ma Solomon olimo paka ma nyamicala omiyo go.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Aka ŋecin pa kere Hiram kodi kere Solomon ma jokelo zahabu wok Ofir bende jokelo mbawin ma yen m'ilwoŋo ni algum kodi telin ma welo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomon ooro mbawin me ma geto madala ma Ot pa Were kodi ma peco pere, kodi timo adungin kodi tongol ri jower. Nger mbawo ma yen algum no fodi k'oneno kendo tundo kiri konon i piny Yuda.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kere Solomon omiyo nyamicala ma Seba kisi gima go okwayo, medo i wi mic man manyakwer m'oyido omiyo go. Kenyo nyamicala odok i Seba gi jotic pere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lim pa kere Solomon",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisi oro kere Solomon oyido limo zahabu ma romo kilo 23,000 ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "medo i wi misolo wok bongi jomitan, kerin pa Jowarabu kodi jogavana mar'adec ma Isiraili.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomon otimo kwote malac 200 gi zahabu. Kisi kwot acel otim gi zahabu kilo ma romo abirio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomon bende otimo kwote mathindho 300. Kisi kwot acel otim gi zahabu ma romo kilo ario. Kwote me je okethi i Kisika ma lul ma Lebanon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomon bende otimo kom ma dhum malac gi tungi liec, aka oum gi zahabu macil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kom ma dhum oyido nitie gi madalin aucel kiri malo, kodi cal ma simbwor i gike ma kisi madala, joje cal ma simbwor apar g'ario. Yuŋey kom ma dhum oyido nitie cal ma wic thwon, aka kabuti kisi cinge ario oyido nitie cal ma simbwor. Nger kom ma dhum me oyido fodi k'obedo i ker moro je.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.19+1KI.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.19",
              "1KI.10.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.19+1KI.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.19",
              "1KI.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atewe je ma medho oyido otim gi zahabu, kiri g'atewe ma Kisika ma Lul ma Lebanon je otim gi zahabu macil, rupiri i ndir pa Solomon feza oyido ongoye gi cwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomon oyido nitie gi bogi ma mel ma jocewere gi bogi pa Hiram. Dicel i kisi oro adek bogi pere oyido dwoko m'otiŋo zahabu, feza, tungi liec, oŋer ambu, kodi oŋere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kere Solomon oyido oŋaŋ aka riek loyo kere man je, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:24"
