        },
        {
          "text": "Kisi ŋat'obino neno go kelo rigo mic ma gigipiny m'otimi gi feza, zahabu, nangin, gilweny, gigipiny maŋwe kur, kayina kodi punde. Gime omedere kisi oro.",
